msgid "Oh, and picture books, those too."
msgstr "Oh, et des livres d'images aussi."

msgid "@niko_speak I like pictures!"
msgstr "@niko_speak J'aime les images !"

msgid "The Author's latest books are really something, yeah?"
msgstr "Les derniers livres de l'Auteur sont vraiment bons, pas vrai ?"

msgid "The head librarian just released a bunch last week!"
msgstr "La bibliothécaire en chef vient d'en publier un tas la semaine dernière !"

msgid "They're big compendiums, you'll see them if you look around."
msgstr "Ce sont de gros recueils, tu les trouveras facilement si tu cherches un peu."

msgid "Kinda different from his earlier works, though."
msgstr "Ça change un peu de ses premiers travaux, ceci dit."

msgid "I'm used to reading his travel logs and novels, mostly."
msgstr "D'habitude, je lis surtout ses carnets de voyage et ses romans."

msgid "I'm on my 3rd cup."
msgstr "C'est ma 3e tasse."

msgid "I can't feel my limbs..."
msgstr "Je ne sens plus mes mains..."

msgid "@niko um..."
msgstr "@niko Hum..."

msgid "BUT I HAVE TO STAY AWAKE."
msgstr "MAIS JE NE DOIS PAS M'ENDORMIR."

msgid "I NEED TO FIND OUT HOW THIS BOOK ENDS..."
msgstr "JE DOIS CONNAÎTRE LA FIN DE CE LIVRE..."

msgid "@niko2 Ummm...."
msgstr "@niko2 Hummm..."

msgid "CURSE THE AUTHOR AND HIS BEAUTIFUL CLIFFHANGERS..."
msgstr "MAUDIT SOIT L'AUTEUR ET SES MOMENTS DE SUSPENSE INSOUTENABLES..."

msgid "@niko This dry erase board is made of metal."
msgstr "@niko Ce tableau est en métal."

msgid "cardquest + desk"
msgstr "recherche de carte + comptoir"

